# MegaFlash Apple-bus bring-up for MAME bridge (-a2bus-bridge).
# PHI0 so IsAppleConnected(); core1launch for BusLoop. No USB console.
# Cooperative guest-time is slow vs wall clock; wait for core0 past crt0/.data
# before launching core1 so LoadAllConfigs can seed user settings.

10ms: gpio20 1
10ms: gpio19 0
50ms: a2phi
2000ms: core1launch
